@baseUrl = http://localhost:5189

### Test 1 - Valid enrollment → 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "courseCode": "CSE-101"
}

### Test 2 - Invalid format → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "courseCode": "invalid"
}

### Test 3 - Non-existent course → 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "courseCode": "ZZZ-999"
}

### Test 4 - Duplicate enrollment → 409 (run Test 1 first)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "courseCode": "CSE-101"
}
### V2 - Get courses (should show Cache MISS first time, Cache HIT second time)
GET http://localhost:5189/api/v2/courses